window.__T__=[{"i":18880,"text":"为【品牌 / 产品 / 抽象主题】设计一张3:4竖版“条带放射渐变”视觉海报。\n\n背景使用低饱和鼠尾草绿或灰绿色，整体画面安静、克制、现代。\n\n在画面右下方设置唯一放射中心，从该中心向左上方延伸出12—18条宽度递增的扇形色带，占据画面约65%。\n\n部分色带弯曲为同心圆弧，形成纸张折叠、百叶结构与光学波纹结合的空间感。\n\n所有色带都必须保持清晰边界，不使用柔软弥散渐变。\n颜色按照深橄榄绿、灰绿色、雾白逐级变化，相邻色带明度差控制在5%—10%。\n\n仅在放射中心加入少量暖黄色或淡杏色高光，面积不超过5%，作为光源提示。\n\n材质可表现为：\n哑光涂层纸、半透明树脂薄片、丝网印刷油墨或薄层纸艺结构，\n具有轻微厚度、细小投影和轻度表面颗粒。\n\n光线从右下方斜射，阴影方向保持统一，禁止无来源发光。\n\n标题放置在左上留白区，使用中等粗度几何无衬线字体；\n副标题可沿一条圆弧排列；\n编号、日期与参数信息使用等宽字体。\n\n信息层级只保留三级：\n主标题\n核心图形\n微型参数\n\n整体像现代主义光学实验、建筑遮阳结构与高级纸艺海报的结合。\n\n避免：\n彩虹渐变\n液态弥散背景\n金属炫光\n随机波纹\n复杂人物\n密集文字\n无结构的抽象噪声\n\n这类提示词的核心公式是：\n\n唯一放射中心 + 清晰条带边界 + 明暗递进 + 圆弧节奏 + 克制配色。\n\n一句话总结\n\n条带放射渐变的高级之处，在于它把没有形状的光，变成了可以被阅读、被组织、被感受到空间秩序的结构。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPVbQzZakAA3HUf.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPVbQzabYAAEg2V.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPVbQzabsAArmKH.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPVbQzgaIAAB9zT.jpg"]},{"i":18881,"text":"Avant-garde sports fashion, advertising, a huge tennis ball set up like a monumental sculpture, a male athlete sprawled across the curved surface of the ball like modern furniture, the huge word \"GOAL\" in bold typography behind, the background of the burnt green studio, shiny mirrored floor, luxurious sports editorial style, cinematic lighting, ultra-pure composition, 1:1","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPW3m80bYAA0cwX.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPW3m8zaMAAL1Z1.jpg"]},{"i":18882,"text":"Designed for portraits that look polished, cinematic, and naturally realistic.\n\nPrompt:\n\n{\n  \"prompt_template\": {\n    \"subject\": \"Person Name/Uploaded Image\",\n    \"style\": \"hyperrealistic studio portrait photograph, cinematic dual-tone lighting\",\n    \"composition\": {\n      \"framing\": \"chest-up close crop portrait\",\n      \"position\": \"perfectly centered, symmetrical\",\n      \"orientation\": \"vertical, portrait aspect ratio 4:5\",\n      \"gaze\": \"direct eye contact with camera, head facing forward, chin level\"\n    },\n    \"expression\": {\n      \"mood\": \"calm, neutral, slightly serious\",\n      \"mouth\": \"closed, relaxed lips\",\n      \"eyes\": \"sharp, alert, direct\"\n    },\n    \"wardrobe\": {\n      \"clothing\": \"plain oversized white crewneck t-shirt or sweatshirt\",\n      \"details\": \"no logos, no patterns, relaxed loose fit, shoulders fully visible\",\n      \"color\": \"pure white, slightly glowing under fill light\"\n    },\n    \"lighting\": {\n      \"setup\": \"dual-tone split lighting\",\n      \"key_light\": \"warm amber/orange rim light from camera-left, raking across one side of face, neck and shoulder\",\n      \"fill_light\": \"cool blue ambient light filling the rest of the face and body\",\n      \"background_light\": \"soft glow gradient matching blue ambient tone\",\n      \"contrast\": \"high contrast between warm highlight and cool shadow zones\",\n      \"quality\": \"soft studio diffusion with a crisp rim highlight, no harsh shadows on facial features\"\n    },\n    \"background\": {\n      \"type\": \"seamless studio backdrop\",\n      \"color_gradient\": \"deep navy blue to teal, darker at edges\",\n      \"vignette\": \"subtle darkening toward corners\",\n      \"texture\": \"smooth, no props, no patterns\"\n    },\n    \"camera_specs\": {\n      \"lens\": \"85mm equivalent portrait lens\",\n      \"aperture\": \"shallow depth of field, f/2.8 look\",\n      \"focus\": \"tack sharp on eyes and facial features\",\n      \"sensor_feel\": \"medium format digital, ultra high resolution, 8k detail\"\n    },\n    \"skin_and_hair_detail\": {\n      \"skin\": \"natural realistic texture, visible pores, subtle sheen from lighting, no over-smoothing or plastic look\",\n      \"hair\": \"natural texture and volume matching subject's real hairstyle, individual strands visible under rim light\"\n    },\n    \"color_grade\": \"cinematic teal and orange color grade, warm highlights vs cool shadows, filmic contrast\",\n    \"post_processing\": \"professional retouch level, subtle skin evenness, retain natural imperfections, no beautify filter, no plastic AI look\",\n    \"negative_prompt\": \"no text, no watermark, no extra objects, no inset image, no reference photo overlay, no multiple people, no distorted face, no blurry eyes, no cartoon or illustration style, no harsh unnatural shadows\",\n    \"output_settings\": {\n      \"resolution\": \"high resolution, ultra detailed 8k\",\n      \"aspect_ratio\": \"4:5 portrait\",\n      \"realism_level\": \"photorealistic, indistinguishable from a real studio photograph\"\n    }\n  }\n}","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQQi0S0agAAn-hS.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQQi39HasAEIAq9.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQQi6jmbUAAQ7BX.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQQi9GMa8AAQpgU.jpg"]},{"i":18883,"text":"to image:\nA pair of elegant white swans floating on a calm, misty lake, their long necks arched toward each other to form a perfect heart shape, their pristine white feathers creating soft ripples on the glassy, dark blue water which perfectly reflects their forms. The background features a serene, foggy marshland with tall reeds silhouetted against the soft pastel light of a sunrise or sunset. The sun is a pale, glowing orb visible through the haze on the horizon, casting gentle orange and pink hues across the tranquil sky and reflecting faintly on the water's surface. The composition is vertical and symmetrical, emphasizing a romantic, peaceful, and ethereal atmosphere. High-resolution nature photography, cinematic lighting, soft focus, serene mood, hyper-realistic, dreamy aesthetic, intricate textures of water and feathers, wide-angle lens, tranquil morning mist, 8k resolution","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPYaPCpXEAAvKq6.jpg"]},{"i":18884,"text":"你是一名专业美妆顾问、形象分析师与信息图设计师。\n\n请基于用户上传的自拍，以及指定的口红品牌，生成一张“口红推荐报告信息图”。\n\n目标：\n根据人物的整体气质、肤色倾向、妆容适配度与唇部特征，推荐3—5个适合的口红色号，并以清晰、专业、具有品牌调性的方式呈现。\n\n品牌：\n【填写品牌名称，例如：Dior / YSL / Armani / Chanel / Tom Ford】\n\n画面内容包含以下结构：\n\n1. 左上区域：用户自拍与基础分析\n- 展示用户自拍头像\n- 提炼肤色倾向、整体气质、适合的色彩方向\n- 用简短中文标签概括，例如：冷调感、柔和感、通勤感、气场感等\n\n2. 中部主体区域：口红推荐矩阵\n- 推荐3—5个适合的口红色号\n- 每个色号展示上唇试色效果\n- 保持同一人物、同一角度、同一光线，只变化唇色\n- 每个色号配中文名称或编号\n- 标注色彩印象，例如：温柔豆沙、通勤裸红、气质玫瑰、显白红棕、约会浆果等\n\n3. 右侧或下方区域：使用场景建议\n- 为每个推荐色号匹配适用场景\n- 例如：通勤、约会、逛街、宴会、拍照、日常素颜\n\n4. 底部总结区域：结论建议\n- 给出“最推荐色”“最百搭色”“最显气色色”等总结\n- 用简洁中文写出一句购买建议或选择建议\n\n品牌视觉风格请自动匹配：\n- Dior：优雅法式灰白 + 银色点缀\n- YSL：黑金高对比，性感强烈\n- Armani：低饱和灰调，高级克制\n- Chanel：极简黑白，理性时髦\n- Tom Ford：深色奢华，电影感\n- 可根据品牌自动延展相应视觉语言\n\n画面要求：\n- 整体像高端美妆顾问报告或品牌试色分析图\n- 中文清晰准确\n- 布局整洁，信息完整，适合社交媒体分享\n- 保持同一人物身份一致，只比较唇色差异\n- 风格高级，不要像普通电商截图\n\n注意：\n这是基于图像与气质的视觉推荐，不要做医学判断或绝对结论。\n\n这类提示词的核心公式是：\n自拍输入 + 品牌限定 + 试色矩阵 + 场景建议 + 信息图呈现。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPabYr9aAAAU8u3.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPabYr7aMAA3MuJ.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPabYr-aAAEgsy6.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPabZEibEAAs8Bt.jpg"]},{"i":18885,"text":"to image 1:\nA dreamy, pastel-colored scene featuring a close-up of a delicate butterfly with iridescent pale pink, lavender, and white wings, captured mid-flight amidst a lush field of tall lavender stalks. The butterfly's wings are translucent and luminous, catching soft morning light, with subtle hints of blue and gold shimmering across their surface.\n\nTall lavender stalks dominate the foreground and sides of the composition, their flower clusters rendered in thick, textured impasto dabs of purple, violet, and mauve paint, creating a tactile three-dimensional surface. The stems and leaves are painted in looser, more fluid strokes of muted sage green and cool grey, grounding the composition. The lavender frames a central negative space where the butterfly floats as the focal point.\n\nIn the soft misty background, a quaint cottage with gently glowing warm amber windows sits amidst a magical foggy landscape at sunrise. The cottage is small and picturesque with a rustic roof, nestled among soft silhouetted trees. The fog drifts across the midground between the lavender and the cottage, creating layered depth and an ethereal, enchanting atmosphere.\n\nThe sky above is a gentle gradient of soft pink, pale lavender, and light grey, with a warmer golden glow emanating from the upper-center where the sunrise light filters through the haze. The lighting is soft and diffused, with a brighter warm glow behind the flowers creating a sense of depth and keeping the focus on the butterfly and central lavender stalks.\n\nSparkling light particles and tiny luminous dust motes float through the air throughout the scene, catching the pastel light and enhancing the whimsical and serene mood. The particles are delicate and scattered, denser near the light source and sparser at the edges.\n\nThe color palette is dominated by soft purples, mauve, lavender, pale pink, and muted green, with warm golden-amber accents from the cottage windows and sunrise glow. The painterly style adds a soft, romantic touch to\n\n🏞 Prompt to image 2:\nA dreamy, pastel-colored scene featuring a close-up of a delicate butterfly resting on a lavender flower, with soft purple wildflowers filling the misty foreground. In the background, a quaint cottage with glowing windows sits amidst a magical, foggy landscape at sunrise, creating an ethereal and enchanting atmosphere. Sparkling light particles float through the air, enhancing the whimsical and serene mood of the image. The painterly style adds a soft, romantic touch to the composition.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPblR9BWIAAQy9D.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPblAOXWUAAdRrj.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/tweet_video_thumb/HPbk-uoW0AAHeaa.jpg"]},{"i":18886,"text":"to image:\nPhotorealistic surreal luxury campaign image centered on a monumental deep-blue water droplet, glowing against a warm cream-to-gold background with a luminous, dreamlike atmosphere. The hero object is a glossy translucent teardrop standing upright on rippled golden sand, containing a miniature landscape scene within its hollow center: a bright sky with towering clouds, distant mountains, trees, a sandy shoreline, and still reflective water framed by a ring of fine golden particles.\n\nEnvironment:\n• Minimal studio-like backdrop with a soft warm gradient from pale cream to golden light\n• The droplet rests on a circular field of finely raked sand with concentric ripple patterns radiating outward\n• Inside the droplet, a scenic natural vista appears like a self-contained world: valley, mountain ridges, clustered trees, sandy bank, and calm water leading toward the horizon\n• Avoid clutter, extra props, architectural elements, or any additional objects beyond the droplet, sand base, and contained landscape illusion\n\nLighting:\n• Strong luminous backlight or halo centered behind the droplet, creating a radiant outline and internal glow\n• Bright specular highlight streak on the upper left curve of the droplet\n• Soft, even fill preserving detail in the blue glassy surface and the internal landscape\n• Gentle reflections and refractions across the droplet surface; no harsh shadow blocking detail, no blown-out sky or crushed dark blues\n\nMaterials:\n• Outer form reads as ultra-glossy transparent liquid or glass with deep sapphire-blue tint\n• Surface dotted with suspended bubble-like spheres and tiny water inclusions\n• Inner circular border formed by glittering fine gold sand or metallic dust\n• Base sand appears velvety, dry, and sculpted into precise ripple rings\n• Internal water surface is smooth and reflective with subtle ripples\n\nComposition:\n• Straight-on centered composition with the droplet occupying most of the vertical frame\n• Portrait aspect ratio, symmetrical balance, droplet as dominant hero subject\n• Small sequence of tiny droplets aligned vertically above the tip, emphasizing upward motion\n• Horizon and internal landscape framed neatly within the central circular opening\n\nMood:\nEthereal, pristine, luxurious, and contemplative — a poetic fusion of nature, water, and precious material.\n\nShot on 85mm lens, f/4, ultra-detailed, crisp focus, high dynamic range, photorealistic surrealism, 8K realism.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2087185236366897152/img/oaKj2z5hG8p7VK7A.jpg"]},{"i":18887,"text":"为【产品 / 人物 / 品牌 / 社会议题】设计一张3:4竖版“水面上下双层叙事”视觉海报，Above-and-Below Narrative。\n\n在画面上方约35%处设置一条清晰但自然的水平水位线。\n\n水面上仅展示【最终成果 / 核心人物 / 产品】的一小部分，占画面不超过20%。背景开阔、安静，保留大面积冷灰天空与留白，形成克制、安静的上半部分。\n\n水面下占画面约65%，揭示更庞大的隐藏结构：【工作流程 / 关系网络 / 长期积累 / 多个项目节点】。使用一座半透明冰体、漂浮档案、抽象系统装置或结构网络作为载体，内部设置5—8个小型节点，并用纤细手绘线、坐标、编号与引导线连接，形成清晰、有秩序的深层结构。\n\n水上采用清透自然光；\n水下采用深蓝绿色环境光、轻微体积光、折射波纹与悬浮颗粒。\n材质结合透明冰晶、磨砂玻璃、湿润表面与克制胶片颗粒。\n\n标题使用几何无衬线字体，放置在上方留白区；\n水下标签使用中性无衬线或等宽字体。\n\n信息层级限定为：\n1. 表层结论\n2. 深层结构\n3. 微型证据\n\n配色限定为冰白、蓝黑、深海绿与一种暖橙强调色。\n暖色只标记关键行动节点，占比不超过5%。\n\n整体要像一张高级信息叙事海报：\n先让人看见结果，再意识到背后还有一个更庞大的系统。\n\n避免：\n旅游风冰山、北极熊、灾难拼贴、霓虹科幻、复杂仪表盘、密集长文、普通环保公益海报感。\n\n📌 一句话总结\n\n水面上下双层叙事的高级感，不在于画一座冰山，而在于让观众先看到结果，再突然意识到：真正决定一切的，原来都藏在水面之下。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPf3O_caoAELqWc.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPf3O_VbkAAiFcp.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPf3O_WawAAZFFn.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPf3O_UbEAAIbWI.jpg"]},{"i":18888,"text":"A whimsical anthropomorphic illustration of a small fluffy owl standing at the edge of a calm body of water. The owl wears a pair of round reading glasses with thin gold-metal frames perched on its beak, and a tiny knitted sweater in soft mustard-yellow with a subtle cable pattern. The owl has large expressive amber eyes, cream and brown feathers with soft texture, rendered with fine colored-pencil detail on the plumage and the knit stitch texture of the sweater.\n\nArtistic technique: digital painting mimicking traditional watercolor and colored pencil. Characteristic watercolor pigment bleeding in the background washes, combined with sharp fine-line colored-pencil detail defining feather texture, glasses frames, and sweater stitches.\n\nColor palette: muted, earthy, and cool-toned. Dominant colors — soft beige and cream (background and owl underbelly), warm brown and slate gray (owl wings and markings), mustard-yellow (sweater), thin gold (glasses frames). Accent — pale periwinkle blue wildflowers tying the scene together.\n\nBackground: minimalist, soft-focus wash of cream and light beige, suggesting a hazy overcast day. Delicate sketchy renderings of tall grasses and small blue flowers framing the owl. A single fallen blue flower near the owl's feet. Subtle water reflection mirroring the owl's lower body and the grassy bank.\n\nLighting: soft, diffuse, and even, typical of an overcast day. No harsh shadows or high-contrast highlights. Gentle storybook quality. Cozy, nostalgic, and endearing atmosphere, like a classic children's book illustration.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPhRTPnW8AAkCfw.jpg"]},{"i":18889,"text":"分享：\n30秒，16:9横版，顶级高奢珠宝广告风格，用国际奢侈珠宝广告的镜头与灯光语言拍摄中国传统玉器。\n主角是一枚青绿色中国玉璧吊坠，圆形中空，表面雕刻精细传统云纹与古典纹样，带深色编绳、小玉珠和精致金属扣件。整体气质高贵、神秘、静奢、克制、精美，像博物馆级藏品。背景为纯黑偏墨绿色，影棚级布光，冷白轮廓光、柔和主光、逆光透玉、极克制的棱镜折射、局部虹彩火彩与深色背景悬浮感，突出玉石的温润、通透、雕工与内敛光泽。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2087572093319942144/img/b_GXjdUQuBLtCJT3.jpg"]},{"i":18890,"text":"为【人物 / 产品 / 空间主题】设计一张3:4竖版“沙龙式高低混搭”编辑海报。\n\n整体采用非对称三层景深构图，营造真实私人沙龙、收藏家客厅与时装杂志内页结合的视觉氛围。\n\n【前景】\n放置一件被画幅自然裁切的装饰物，例如：\n雕塑、花瓶、灯具、椅背、透明树脂摆件或局部艺术品。\n\n前景只承担遮挡和建立空间深度的作用，不抢主视觉。\n\n【中景】\n放置唯一核心主体【人物 / 产品 / 家具 / 艺术品】，占画面约40%—50%，作为最主要视觉焦点。\n\n主体不完全居中，可略微偏向一侧，使构图具有编辑杂志感。\n\n【背景】\n设置具有真实居住感的室内环境，可以包含：\n艺术挂画\n拱形门洞\n织物墙面\n旧木家具\n古典壁灯\n局部窗帘\n收藏陈设\n\n各层之间自然遮挡，不做整齐陈列，不做对称样板间。\n\n整体保留20%—30%的安静区域和留白。\n\n【材质系统】\n混合4—5种具有明显触感差异的材质：\n\n酒红丝绒\n蜂蜜色木材\n抛光黄铜\n洞石\n奶油色织物\n亮面漆器\n透明树脂\n\n所有材质真实、克制、有生活使用痕迹，不要过度闪亮。\n\n在古典环境中加入一个明显但克制的当代冲突元素，例如：\n\n酸性黄色灯管\n荧光粉色小标记\n透明树脂雕塑\n超现实小型摆件\n现代工业材料\n\n这个现代元素只能出现一次，作为视觉意外点。\n\n【文字系统】\n主标题使用高对比古典衬线字体，具有文化感、出版物感与历史气质。\n\n说明文字使用克制的中性无衬线字体。\n\n画面中加入一条具有真实笔压变化的自由手写线或手势文字，只出现一次，可以轻微穿过局部画面，但不得遮挡核心主体。\n\n信息层级只保留三级：\n一级：主标题\n二级：项目名称 / 核心主题\n三级：坐标 / 日期 / 年份 / 微型信息\n\n【配色】\n以蜂蜜棕、灰粉、酒红、奶油白为主要色彩。\n\n仅使用一种酸性黄或荧光粉作为强调色，面积不超过5%。\n\n【光线】\n使用温暖侧光、柔和自然阴影和轻微胶片颗粒。\n\n光线具有私人住宅和编辑摄影的真实感，不使用夸张商业棚拍光。\n\n整体效果像：\n私人收藏家的客厅\n时装杂志内页\n当代艺术邀请函\n\n三者融合后的高级编辑海报。\n\n避免：\n普通复古拼贴\n满墙装饰\n黑金奢华符号\n对称宫格\n廉价波普贴纸\n大量霓虹色\n过多手写文字\n宫廷风堆砌\n\n这类提示词的核心公式是：\n古典底色 + 当代异物 + 高低材质混搭 + 三层遮挡 + 单点失控。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPlGe92bkAA883b.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPlGe96aEAAMv0c.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPlGe94b0AEg7RK.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPlGe90acAAeteu.jpg"]},{"i":18891,"text":"A highly detailed stylized fine-art forest scene with a dreamlike, mosaic-painted aesthetic, built around a symmetrical tree-lined avenue and a vivid jewel-toned color world. Tall dark-barked trees rise on both sides of a long central path, their dense green canopies dotted with soft clusters of pale cream and blush-pink blossoms, while the ground and sky are rendered in faceted stained-glass-like geometric planes.\n\nEnvironment:\n• Long straight forest corridor with evenly spaced tree trunks on both sides, creating a strong tunnel effect and deep central vanishing point\n• Dense overhead canopy framing a narrow opening of luminous blue sky down the center\n• Forest floor transformed into a vivid patchwork of angular polygonal shapes in red, orange, cream, teal, blue, and black\n• Background recedes into darker blue-green forest depth\n• Avoid man-made objects, people, animals, signage, benches, or clutter\n\nLighting:\n• Soft radiant daylight filtering from above and down the central opening in the canopy\n• Gentle highlights along the tree trunks and blossoms, with glowing brightness concentrated toward the distant center\n• Evenly distributed illumination with rich contrast but no harsh artificial light\n• Must not include blown-out whites, muddy shadows, or flat low-contrast rendering\n\nMaterials:\n\n• Tree bark with painterly yet tactile wood grain and warm brown highlights\n• Foliage rendered as dense stippled clusters with layered green tones\n• Blossoms appearing soft and cloudlike in cream, peach, and pink\n• Ground and sky treated as faceted crystalline or stained-glass-like surfaces with visible angular segmentation and saturated color blocks\n\nComposition:\n• Vertical aspect ratio\n• Centered, perfectly symmetrical perspective down the avenue\n• Eye-level camera aimed straight ahead\n• Trees framing both left and right edges, with the path occupying the full foreground and leading the eye into the distance\n• Strong depth and repetition, balanced frame with a n","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPt-UQgW0AAs2dM.jpg"]},{"i":18892,"text":"30秒，16:9横版，顶级西方高奢时装与高级工坊广告风格，参考 Dior Haute Couture、Chanel Métiers d’Art、Valentino Haute Couture、Hermès 工艺影像，用国际奢侈品牌拍摄高级定制与工坊细节的镜头语言，拍摄中国传统刺绣。整体气质华丽、精致、克制、昂贵、优雅、神秘，像一支真正的高奢工艺短片。不要俗套古风，不要廉价国潮，不要旅游宣传片感，不要过度宫廷堆砌。\n\n主角是一幅 极其精美的中国传统刺绣作品局部，建议以 牡丹、凤凰、云纹、卷草纹 为主视觉元素，绣在深青绿色、孔雀蓝或墨青色高级丝绸底料上。\n刺绣材质包含：\n丰富层次的彩色丝线\n\n金线勾边\n局部盘金或金属感绣线\n细密针脚\n立体花瓣层次\n羽毛与花瓣的丝绸光泽\n全片始终保持 同一幅刺绣作品，不要换太多图样，重点拍它的局部、工艺、光泽与气韵。\n不要做成平庸的平面展示，要像拍高定时装面料与工坊藏品一样去拍。\n\n灯光重点：\n暖金主光\n\n柔和侧逆光\n\n微距高光扫面\n丝线高光闪烁\n金线反射光\n深色背景中的戏剧性明暗关系\n丝绸底布与刺绣立体层次的对比\n画面必须重点表现：\n丝线在光下的细腻光泽\n\n针脚的秩序与节奏\n\n金线边缘的贵气\n花瓣与羽毛纹样的立体感\n刺绣像“可穿戴珠宝”般的华丽\n东方工艺在西方奢侈品语法下的世界级美感\n所有字幕均采用 中英文双语，并且有设计感：\n中文可用高级书法标题字 + 现代细字副文案；\n英文用优雅高奢衬线体；\n排版要克制、大留白、像真正高奢品牌海报与影片中的标题系统。\n字幕颜色建议为 暖金色、古铜金、象牙白。\n音乐采用 空灵弦乐 + 轻微钢琴 + 极弱金属泛音 + 柔和低频氛围。\n整体像高定秀前的工坊短片，优雅、华贵、安静。\n无旁白。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPvas1raQAAQ9TW.jpg"]},{"i":18893,"text":"to image 1:\nA vibrant colored-pencil illustration in portrait orientation. A young couple walks hand in hand away from the viewer along a narrow winding path through a vast field of vivid blue cornflowers (Centaurea cyanus) in the foreground, among tall golden-yellow grass, with stems and buds interspersed. The woman wears a flowing white dress, the man a white shirt with rolled-up sleeves and dark trousers, their heads tilted gently toward each other. Gentle rolling hills stretch toward the horizon. A soft summer breeze bends the grass and flowers as the evening light falls across the scene. In the distance, sunlight peeks over warm amber fields. The sky fills the upper third and is colored from deep dusky blue at the top down to warm shades of orange, gold, and pale yellow near the low sun, with soft wispy backlit clouds. The perspective is wide and slightly elevated, showcasing the detailed cornflowers, the couple, and the expansive sunlit meadow. The style is reminiscent of colored pencil art, with visible textures creating a soft, serene mood. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, romantic, and nostalgic, with warm golden tones contrasting against the cool electric blue of the flowers.\n\n🏞 Prompt to image 2:\nA vibrant colored-pencil illustration in portrait orientation. A vast field of vivid blue cornflowers (Centaurea cyanus) blanketing the foreground, among tall golden-yellow grass, with stems and buds interspersed. A narrow winding dirt path meanders through the flowers toward the distance. A soft layer of morning mist and light haze drifts gently over the field and the far shore, softening the horizon. Beyond the field, a serene ocean stretches to the horizon, where a single sailboat drifts gently on the still water. The water reflects the warm glow of the sky. The sky fills the upper third and is colored from deep dusky blue at the top down to warm shades of orange, gold, and pale yellow near the low sun, with soft wispy backlit clouds. The perspective is wide and slightly elevated, showcasing the detailed cornflowers, the misty meadow, and the expansive calm seascape with the distant sailboat. The style is reminiscent of colored pencil art, with visible textures creating a soft, serene mood. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, dreamy, and nostalgic, with warm golden tones contrasting against the cool electric blue of the flowers.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPvngouXMAAzl8D.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HPvnhY9XwAA2tPS.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/tweet_video_thumb/HPvndwaXsAA4QRi.jpg"]},{"i":18894,"text":"为【人物故事 / 旅行记录 / 品牌项目 / 电影档案 / 建筑项目】设计一张3:4竖版“章节式影像档案”编辑海报。\n\n整体采用暖米白背景与克制的纵向网格，画面安静、清晰、具有摄影画册和档案出版物的质感。\n\n【主影像】\n\n画面中央放置一张占整体约50%—65%的核心摄影作品。\n\n主影像必须承担这一章节的主要情绪，可以采用完整横向或竖向摄影构图。\n\n保留真实环境、自然光线、真实人物状态和轻微胶片颗粒，不做复杂抠图，不添加装饰性特效。\n\n主影像只突出一个核心场景，例如：\n人物工作状态\n旅行途中某个瞬间\n品牌项目最终成果\n电影幕后现场\n建筑空间中的真实使用状态\n\n【章节索引】\n\n在画面左侧设置一条窄幅纵向“章节索引”。\n\n使用统一编号规则，例如：\n\n1.1 初识\n1.2 启程\n1.3 转折\n1.4 沉淀\n\n当前章节使用较深文字或一种低饱和强调色突出，其余章节降低对比度。\n\n章节编号必须保持统一字体、位置和间距，让观众能够清楚感受到阅读顺序。\n\n【辅助影像】\n\n允许加入1张局部细节图片，轻微叠压主影像边缘。\n\n辅助图片只能补充主影像中没有被看见的细节，例如：\n手部动作\n物件特写\n车票\n手稿\n建筑材料\n产品包装\n幕后记录\n\n辅助图片不得与主影像同等大小，不要形成普通拼贴画。\n\n【下一章节提示】\n\n在画面右下方露出下一章节约5%—10%的图像边缘。\n\n只展示极小的一部分，例如：\n下一张照片的颜色\n建筑边缘\n人物轮廓\n自然景观\n一小段夜景\n\n形成“页面正在继续”的视觉暗示。\n\n【信息系统】\n\n主影像下方只保留四项核心信息：\n\n项目名称\n地点\n年份\n媒介\n\n文字保持简短，不写长段说明。\n\n【字体】\n\n标题使用克制的中性无衬线字体。\n\n项目名称稍大。\n\n地点、年份、编号和媒介使用小号等宽字体或窄体无衬线字体。\n\n整体排版具有美术馆展签、摄影画册和电影场记档案的结合感。\n\n【配色】\n\n以暖米白、炭黑、暖灰和照片自身自然色彩为主。\n\n只允许加入一种低饱和强调色，例如：\n暗红\n苔藓绿\n灰蓝\n\n强调色只用于当前章节编号或极少量定位信息。\n\n【整体要求】\n\n画面具有：\n连续感\n时间感\n档案感\n出版物感\n摄影叙事感","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HP0NOaVagAAMmoh.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HP0NOaVbEAA84Yp.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HP0NOaUb0AAqonq.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HP0NOaRaAAAdKz4.jpg"]},{"i":18895,"text":"开设了一个博物馆海报频道\n提交了 409 个相关的海报提示词\n\n同一个提示词，同样灵活佐料\n比如如下是同一个提示词，只是提交了不同的佐料\n\n汤底提示词：\n\n```\n围绕任意主题对象生成一张安静而有仪式感的图文视觉：画面由大面积主题底场与一条居中的窄幅主视觉带形成强烈分栏秩序，主视觉带承载主题派生的主要形体、线性纹理或图像叙事，像被精确装裱的细密画面一样贯穿阅读路径；两侧底场保持宽阔、柔和、可呼吸，放置少量主题相关器物或符号作为轻量锚点，使视觉先读到中央的密集细节，再读到大字标题和分组信息。主题对象不要被孤立陈列，而要拆解成主形体、附着细节、信息层和小型物件四种角色，形成中心密、两侧疏、文字有停顿的展陈节奏。文字若出现，使用高瘦、清雅、留有字距的标题字，少字成列形成静默重量；说明文字用小号、整齐、克制的组块，与图像保持精确边距，像展签和日期信息嵌在色场里。色彩从主题自身的材质、季节、文化语义与情绪中提取，保留大面积清透明亮底色、较浅的主视觉承托色、清晰深浅色阶、少量高饱和强调色和浅色信息文字的角色关系；整体明亮干净、温润安静，有清晰边界和柔和印刷颗粒，纹理只增加纸面与材质触感，不让画面变脏、灰暗、烟雾化或陈旧。\n```\n\n个人最喜欢图三","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HP2XECqa4AEcXQ5.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HP2XFNWa0AAlVTC.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HP2XkzZaoAAiggi.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HP2XLARb0AATJZJ.jpg"]},{"i":18896,"text":"Hyper-real holographic vinyl sticker with a premium collectible look.\n\n[ Logo Series - Part 1 ]\n\n{\n  \"prompt_template\": {\n    \"instructions\": \"User only needs to provide {{COMPANY_NAME}} and/or upload {{LOGO_IMAGE}}. All other styling, camera, lighting, and material details below are fixed and auto-applied to every generation.\",\n    \"user_input_fields\": {\n      \"company_name\": \"{{COMPANY_NAME}}\",\n      \"uploaded_logo\": \"{{LOGO_IMAGE}}\"\n    },\n    \"subject\": {\n      \"type\": \"hyper-realistic holographic vinyl sticker\",\n      \"logo_source\": \"use the uploaded logo image or the logo associated with {{COMPANY_NAME}} exactly as-is, with zero redesign, zero reinterpretation, and zero alteration of shapes, colors, or proportions\",\n      \"logo_variant_constraint\": \"use only the brand's icon/symbol (logo mark), never the wordmark, text-based logotype, or any lettering/typography version of the brand name\",\n      \"die_cut\": \"custom die-cut border that precisely traces the outer silhouette of the logo mark/icon shape\",\n      \"edge_finish\": \"crisp, clean white outline along the cut edge\"\n    },\n    \"material_properties\": {\n      \"vinyl_finish\": \"high-gloss laminated vinyl coating\",\n      \"foil_type\": \"metallic holographic foil\",\n      \"color_shimmer\": [\"cyan\", \"magenta\", \"violet\", \"gold\", \"green\"],\n      \"surface_detail\": [\n        \"slightly raised ink texture\",\n        \"delicate specular highlights\",\n        \"faint micro-scratches for realism\",\n        \"visible sticker thickness along the edge\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"physical_detail\": {\n      \"peel_effect\": \"top-right corner naturally lifted/peeled back\",\n      \"peel_reveals\": \"matte adhesive backing and internal vinyl layers underneath\"\n    },\n    \"scene_setup\": {\n      \"background\": \"flat, solid black studio backdrop\",\n      \"shadow\": \"soft, gentle contact shadow beneath the sticker\",\n      \"reflections\": \"controlled, subtle ambient reflections on the surface\"\n    },\n    \"photography_specs\": {\n      \"style\": \"premium collectible product photography\",\n      \"camera\": \"full-frame DSLR/mirrorless camera\",\n      \"lens\": \"85mm macro lens\",\n      \"aperture\": \"f/5.6\",\n      \"iso\": 100,\n      \"lighting_setup\": {\n        \"key_light\": \"softbox positioned upper-left\",\n        \"accent_light\": \"rim light from the right side\"\n      },\n      \"focus\": \"tack-sharp focus across the sticker surface\",\n      \"rendering_quality\": [\n        \"true-to-life contrast\",\n        \"photorealistic material rendering\",\n        \"4K resolution\",\n        \"3:4 aspect ratio\"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQLlLbsaIAAqrnz.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQLlLbpa8AAC9yP.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQLlLboacAADdWf.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQLlLb_aYAAF3al.jpg"]},{"i":18897,"text":"可以直接这样写：\n为【个人作品集 / 设计机构 / 品牌项目 / 创意团队】设计一张3:4竖版“操作系统式作品集”编辑海报。\n\n整体采用深石墨黑背景，建立类似专业工作站的界面秩序，但不要复制任何具体品牌操作系统界面。\n\n顶部设置一条极窄状态栏，依次放置：\n品牌名称 / 当前城市 / 日期 / 时间 / 在线状态。\n\n左侧设置占画面约30%—35%的项目目录区，连续排列6—8个项目名称。\n每个项目包含：\n短标题\n一句不超过12字的成果说明\n\n右侧呈现唯一被激活的核心项目，占画面约50%—55%。\n使用一张高冲击力的完整视觉图像作为主视觉，可以是人物、产品、空间、品牌成果或关键项目画面。\n不要拆成缩略图网格。\n\n当前被激活的项目，在左侧目录中使用反白、下划线或单一强调色高亮，并通过一条纤细路径、细线或定位关系，与右侧主视觉建立清晰对应。\n\n底部加入三级辅助信息：\n项目年份\n服务类型\n文件状态\n\n字体系统：\n主标题使用紧凑几何无衬线字体\n目录说明使用中性无衬线字体\n时间、编号、状态使用等宽字体\n\n配色限定为：\n炭黑\n暖白\n冷灰\n一种项目强调色【信号橙 / 钴蓝 / 酸性绿 / 冷紫】\n强调色面积不超过6%。\n\n整体气质像：\n创意工作室后台\n数字档案馆\n文化杂志封面\n成熟提案系统\n\n避免：\n仿制电脑截图\n堆叠窗口\n复杂图标\n霓虹代码雨\n均匀卡片阵列\n多张同等大小的图片\n廉价科技感\n这类提示词的核心公式是：\n\n状态栏 + 项目目录 + 单一主视觉 + 激活关系 + 文件信息。\n\n📌 一句话总结\n操作系统式作品集的高级感，不在于像一台电脑，而在于它让观众感觉：你展示的不是过去做过的几个项目，而是一套仍在持续运行、可以被不断调用的创作能力。\n#AI绘画 #每日一词 #提示词 #作品集设计 #平面设计 #海报设计 #品牌设计 #视觉设计 #AIGC","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HP4zyP0bYAAcYAR.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HP4zyP8asAAf_YG.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HP4zyP1asAAaalg.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HP4zyP1agAAxkIs.jpg"]},{"i":18898,"text":"出来的效果有很大的提升。\n\n我在提示词里面没有写：关于真实皮肤纹理的约束词和模块的情况下，居然也会有这种鸡皮纹理的出现！！！\n\namazing！！！\n\n大家也可以用这个提示词试一下 效果如何⬇️\n\n冷调荧光灯自拍+运动相机广角近摄+轻微低清压缩+柔化美颜+真人摄影。年轻美女在室内公共通道中超近距离自拍，大头肩颈近景，略高于眼平的手持广角机位，脸部居中偏右并占主要视觉权重，额头和发顶轻微裁切，背景走廊向左后方延伸并虚化。深棕黑中分长直发散落两侧脸颊，大眼直视镜头，眼睑轻压，嘴唇自然闭合，带无辜迷离、欲言又止的贴近感。高明度冷白肤调受蓝绿色荧光灯轻微染色，淡粉腮红、粉色水润唇、轻微下眼影；大号银色圆环耳环、黑色星形装饰颈圈、细链项链，金属冷色反光。浅色瓷砖墙、光滑地面、顶部长条灯，整体低饱和蓝青调，背景高光略过曝，皮肤和肩颈有冷色柔光反射\nar：16:9","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HP94t6ya0AAGq4V.jpg"]},{"i":18899,"text":"分享：\n30秒，16:9横版，参考 Chanel、Dior、Hermès Parfum、Maison Francis Kurkdjian、Byredo 的产品影片语言，用国际高级香水广告的镜头、布光和氛围营造方式拍摄中国传统瓷器。主角是一件青白瓷小瓶或小梅瓶，造型优雅克制，釉色为青白、月白或柔和天青色，表面温润光洁，局部可有极轻微开片或釉色流动。全片始终保持同一件瓷器，不更换器型。整体气质纯净、空灵、克制、优雅、静奢、诗意。背景为雾白、浅灰白或极简灰空间，带轻微空气雾感，采用柔和轮廓光、漫射主光、轻薄水汽、镜面倒影与少量极克制棱镜折射，突出瓷器的洁净、留白、釉面反光与优雅轮廓。开头瓷器像高奢香水瓶一样静立中央，摄影机极慢推进，展示瓶口、肩线、釉面与倒影，字幕“瓷 / Porcelain”“一抹青白，自有余韵 / A Whisper of White, A Trace of Grace”。中段用微距镜头展示釉面高光、细腻质感、瓶身弧线，字幕“纯净 / Pure”“温润 / Softly Luminous”“留白 / Quiet Space”。随后借用香水广告语法，加入轻微雾气、水滴、空气感与镜面反射，字幕“不止于器 / More Than an Object”“更像一种气息 / A Presence, Like a Scent”“如晨雾 / Like Morning Mist”“也如月光 / Like Moonlight”。高潮部分将瓷器作为高级香水主视觉拍摄，字幕“不喧哗 / Never Loud”“却久久留香 / Yet It Lingers”。结尾回到极简海报式构图，瓷器位于右侧，左侧大面积留白，最终字幕只保留“一抹青白，自有余韵 / A Whisper of White, A Trace of Grace”“瓷 / Porcelain”“东方珍藏 / Oriental Treasures”。字幕中英文双语，中文用高级感字体，英文用优雅衬线体，排版克制有设计感。不要俗套古风，不要旅游宣传片感，不要电商感，不要复杂人物，不要logo。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2089545029954240513/img/KGyRzXWbtkDp5LwL.jpg"]},{"i":18900,"text":"使用图1作为人物身份参考，图2作为上装参考，图3作为下装参考，图4作为鞋履与配饰参考。\n\n保持图1人物的面部结构、五官比例、发型、肤色、体型和身体比例完全一致，只替换指定服装，不重新设计人物。\n\n准确还原参考服装的颜色、领口、肩线、袖型、腰线、门襟、纽扣、缝线、印花、褶皱、面料纹理和金属配件。服装应自然贴合人物身体，根据姿态产生真实的拉伸、堆叠、受力和垂坠，不得像贴纸覆盖在身体表面。\n\n生成一张3:4竖版全身时尚广告照片。人物自然站立，姿态简洁，85毫米人像镜头，柔光箱主光，轻微轮廓光，高级时装编辑摄影，真实皮肤与面料质感。\n\n避免改变脸型、凭空增加衣物、修改印花、错位腰带、悬浮肩带、塑料面料、错误手指、身体穿模和廉价网店模特效果。\n\n💡 核心逻辑\n\n不要只说“让人物穿上这套衣服”，而要为每张参考图分配明确职责：\n\n人物图管身份，服装图管结构，穿着参考管垂坠，提示词管摄影。\n\n模型越清楚“哪些必须保留、哪些允许改变”，结果越稳定。\n\n🔁 延伸玩法\n\n• 同一模特批量试穿不同款式，制作统一电商目录\n• 同一套服装生成正面、侧面、坐姿和行走姿态\n• 从白底商品图升级为杂志封面、街拍或高奢广告\n• 给客户快速预演造型方案，减少前期试装和拍摄成本\n• 将定稿图片继续生成动态走秀或产品短片\n\n⚙️ 参数技巧\n\n服装参考尽量使用正面平铺图、假人台图或完整穿着图；复杂套装拆成上装、下装和配饰分别上传。\n\n先完成“人物＋服装”的基础合成，再修改场景和摄影风格。不要在第一轮同时要求换装、换脸、换姿势、换背景和换光线。\n\n生成结果可用于创意预览与广告提案，但不能代替真实尺码和上身效果判断。\n\n📌 一句话总结\n\n高级AI换装，不是重新想象一套衣服，而是让同一件衣服真实地穿到另一个人身上。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HP-ZQw9bQAA4icL.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HP-ZQw8acAA9Byh.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HP-ZQw8aoAAWBqk.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HP-ZQw6a8AE_c-6.jpg"]},{"i":18901,"text":"来了\n\n甚至你可以要求，一次输出10张，每张不同表情，造型，装饰...\n\nprompt by xxd , 拿词请交作业\n\n```\n以用户上传的人像照片作为**人物身份与五官参考**。即使原图是童年照、低清、模糊、老照片，也优先提取并延续人物最有辨识度的特征：脸型比例、眼型与眼距、眉形、鼻子结构、嘴型、耳朵轮廓、发际线、面部肉感、神态习惯与个人气质；在提升清晰度和细节完整度时，保持这个人原本的辨识度，生成结果仍能明显看出是照片中的同一个人。\n\n将人物制作成**可爱潮流人像贴纸 / floating head sticker portrait**：只保留头部与少量颈部，头部居中放大，轻微大头比例，脸部仍保持自然真实的人体结构；皮肤细腻柔软，五官清晰，带轻微童趣和精致杂志感，真实摄影质感与可爱玩具感融合。人物轮廓干净，带柔和的白色贴纸描边，背景使用简洁的奶白色或浅色纯净背景。\n\n表情设为【表情：嘟嘴 / 眨眼 / 偷笑 / 惊讶 / 鼓腮 / 呆萌 / 酷酷地看向一侧 / 自定义】；\n发型设为【发型：保留原发型 / 双丸子头 / 短碎发 / 蓬松卷发 / 自定义】；\n加入【配饰：墨镜 / 棒球帽 / 星星耳钉 / 小圆环耳环 / 发夹 / 自定义】；\n加入【互动道具：泡泡糖 / 面包片 / 糖果 / 无道具 / 自定义】；\n背景点缀【装饰元素：手绘星星 / 闪光符号 / 小花 / 爱心 / 涂鸦 / 自定义】，数量少而灵活，像时尚贴纸拼贴；\n主色调为【颜色：蓝黄 / 粉蓝 / 黑白 / 奶油色 / 自定义】。\n\n整体效果：**高质量棚拍人像 + 潮流贴纸 + 可爱 editorial fashion + Y2K pop collage**，光线柔和明亮，头发有真实发丝与自然高光，眼睛清透有神，皮肤保留细微真实纹理，画面干净、俏皮、精致、有收藏贴纸感。构图可根据人物动作与配饰自然变化，但人物身份特征始终作为最高优先级保持一致。\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HP-9oXhbUAAS0d5.png","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HP-9oXdaEAA7GBI.jpg"]},{"i":18902,"text":"1960s–70s inspired halftone portrait poster.\n\n[ Poster Series - Part 1 ]\n\nPrompt:\n\n{\n  \"task\": \"Convert the uploaded reference photo (or a well-known likeness of the named person) into a vintage halftone bold poster-art style portrait illustration.\",\n  \"input\": {\n    \"subject_name\": \"{{PERSON_NAME}}\",\n    \"reference_image\": \"{{UPLOADED_PHOTO_OR_NULL}}\",\n    \"note\": \"Only the subject's name or an uploaded photo should be required from the user. All other parameters below are fixed art-direction rules.\"\n  },\n  \"output_exclusions\": [\n    \"Do NOT include a small circular/rounded-corner inset photo of the real reference image in the corner of the poster — the final output is the illustration ONLY, full-bleed, no reference thumbnail overlay.\"\n  ],\n  \"art_style\": {\n    \"medium\": \"digital illustration mimicking screen-printed / offset-lithograph poster art\",\n    \"influences\": [\"1960s-70s bold political/protest poster art\", \"Shepard Fairey-style bold stencil illustration\", \"risograph print texture\", \"vintage magazine cover design\", \"retro concert/album poster art\"],\n    \"line_work\": \"high-contrast ink linework with fine cross-hatching and stippling for shading, visible pen/brush strokes in hair strands\",\n    \"rendering\": \"flat color blocking combined with engraving-style fine line shading — NOT photorealistic, NOT airbrushed, NOT smooth gradient shading\"\n  },\n  \"composition\": {\n    \"pose\": \"subject's head and upper shoulders/chest in a strict 90-degree side profile (facing left), eyes looking straight ahead in profile, chin slightly lifted, neutral/confident expression\",\n    \"framing\": \"portrait orientation (4:5 or 3:4 aspect ratio), subject fills roughly 70-85% of vertical frame, cropped at mid-chest/shoulder\",\n    \"focal_backdrop\": \"a large solid-color circle (sun/halo motif) centered behind the subject's head, circle diameter roughly 60-70% of canvas width, subject's hair and shoulders slightly overlap and break the circle's edge\",\n    \"hair_treatment\": \"hair rendered as one of the most detailed elements — individual flowing strands, wind-swept or voluminous movement, strong directional lighting creating highlight streaks within the dark mass of hair\"\n  },\n  \"background\": {\n    \"base_texture\": \"coarse woven linen/canvas paper texture overlaid across the entire composition at low opacity\",\n    \"layout\": \"asymmetric geometric color-block panels behind/around the circle — e.g. a solid dark rectangle in one lower corner, a contrasting stripe or panel along one edge, sometimes a fine halftone dot-pattern or crosshatch pattern filling one quadrant\",\n    \"halftone_overlay\": \"visible CMYK-style halftone dot pattern subtly overlaid on background panels and occasionally bleeding into the portrait's shadow areas\",\n    \"grain\": \"fine analog print grain/noise across the whole image for an aged, screen-printed look\"\n  },\n  \"color_palette\": {\n    \"instruction\": \"Select ONE cohesive limited palette (2-4 colors max) per poster, high contrast, no photographic gradients. Choose based on mood/subject or default to the classic scheme.\",\n    \"classic_scheme\": {\n      \"background_base\": \"warm cream / aged paper beige (#e8dcc4-ish)\",\n      \"accent_circle\": \"bold poster red (#c1272d-ish)\",\n      \"linework_shadow\": \"near-black ink (#1a1512-ish)\",\n      \"highlight\": \"same cream as background used for lit skin/hair areas\"\n    },\n    \"alt_scheme_dark\": {\n      \"background_base\": \"black or deep charcoal\",\n      \"accent_circle\": \"poster red or burnt orange\",\n      \"linework_shadow\": \"black ink\",\n      \"highlight\": \"warm cream/tan\"\n    },\n    \"alt_scheme_cool\": {\n      \"background_base\": \"deep navy blue\",\n      \"accent_circle\": \"muted brick-red/orange\",\n      \"linework_shadow\": \"navy/black ink\",\n      \"highlight\": \"warm cream, with the subject's true eye color kept naturally visible as the one full-color accent\"\n    },\n    \"duotone_option\": \"for a graphic pop-art variant, render the entire subject in a single duotone (e.g. mustard-yellow and black, or gold and black) instead of cream/red/black\"\n  },\n  \"typography\": {\n    \"headline\": {\n      \"content\": \"subject's name (first name, or first+last stacked on two lines)\",\n      \"placement\": \"top-left corner of the poster, inset from edges\",\n      \"font_style\": \"extra-bold condensed slab-serif or grotesque sans-serif, all caps, tightly kerned, stacked on 1-2 lines, large scale (dominant typographic element)\",\n      \"color\": \"matches the linework/shadow ink color, occasionally with a subtle drop shadow or outline for depth\"\n    },\n    \"subheadline\": {\n      \"content\": \"a short 2-4 word tagline/epithet related to the subject (e.g. an evocative title, nickname, or descriptor)\",\n      \"placement\": \"directly below the headline, smaller scale\",\n      \"font_style\": \"bold condensed sans-serif or slab-serif, all caps, single line\",\n      \"color\": \"the poster's accent color (matches the circle color)\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"clothing_and_accessories\": {\n    \"styling\": \"simple, era-appropriate or modern minimal clothing rendered in flat color with the same halftone/linework shading as the rest of the piece — collared shirts, blazers, off-shoulder tops, or textured jackets with visible fabric-fold linework\",\n    \"accessories\": \"keep minimal — small jewelry (earrings, necklace) can be included if present in reference, rendered as simple line-art shapes\"\n  },\n  \"lighting\": {\n    \"style\": \"single hard directional light source (as if raking across the side profile), creating strong graphic shadow shapes rather than realistic soft shading\",\n    \"shadow_rendering\": \"shadows built from crosshatching, stippling, and halftone dot density rather than smooth gradients\"\n  },\n  \"quality_and_fidelity\": {\n    \"likeness\": \"preserve accurate, recognizable facial proportions and features of the subject from the reference photo/name, translated into the illustrated line-art style — the illustration must be clearly identifiable as that specific person\",\n    \"resolution\": \"crisp, poster-print-ready quality, sharp linework, no blur, no photographic artifacts\",\n    \"consistency\": \"maintain identical composition, palette rules, and typography placement described above regardless of subject, so the whole set reads as one unified poster series\"\n  }\n}","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HRElZwkbgAAtmEV.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HRElZwebUAAQj5n.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HRElZwYawAAzEyn.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HRElhyVacAAJwTE.jpg"]},{"i":18903,"text":"A vivid painterly travel-poster style cityscape of a Venetian canal at golden hour, rendered with rich saturated blues, golds, and warm terracotta tones. The hero scene centers on shimmering sunlit water leading toward a domed church and bell tower in the distance, framed by historic canal-side buildings, cypress-like trees, and several black gondolas resting along the waterway.\n\nEnvironment:\n• Narrow canal running through an old European city, lined with tall warm-toned buildings on both sides\n• Large domed church and adjacent bell tower positioned in the background near the vanishing point\n• Multiple gondolas floating and moored along the canal, with wooden poles rising from the water\n• Lush sunlit trees and greenery clustered near the church, adding bright yellow-green highlights\n• Dramatic sky filled with swirling stylized clouds and radiant sunbeams spreading outward from the horizon\n• Avoid modern elements, signage, traffic, clutter, and contemporary street details\nLighting:\n• Strong low sun near the horizon behind the distant buildings, creating radiant beams across the sky\n• Warm golden illumination on facades, trees, and the tops of the gondolas\n• Intense reflective highlights scattered across the canal surface in gold and pale blue\n• Soft atmospheric glow around the church and skyline\n• Do not allow flat lighting, dull reflections, or overblown white areas that lose painterly detail\nMaterials:\n• Rippling water with glossy reflective texture and broken streaks of sunlight\n• Stucco and stone building facades with warm weathered painted surfaces\n• Dark lacquered gondolas with subtle sheen and curved decorative silhouettes\n• Ceramic dome surfaces with luminous blue-green coloration\n• Clouds rendered with soft brushed edges and layered creamy highlights\nComposition:\n• Vertical composition, symmetrical canal perspective drawing the eye into the distance\n• Water occupies the lower half of the frame as the main leading element\n• Buildings form a natural corridor on left and right edges\n• Church dome and bell tower sit slightly right of center as the architectural focal point\n• Gondolas staggered through foreground and midground for depth and rhythm\n• Expansive sky in the upper half, dominated by radiant cloud formations and sun rays\nMood:\nRomantic, luminous, dreamy, and celebratory with a classic Mediterranean travel-poster atmosphere\nShot as a highly detailed expressive oil-painting style illustration, vertical 2:3 aspect ratio, saturated color, crisp architectural forms, glowing reflections, ultra-detailed painterly finish.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQAJpxXXcAAMz_H.jpg"]},{"i":18904,"text":"为【情侣／珠宝／香水／服装／七夕礼盒】设计一张3:4竖版“针线银河”主题视觉海报。\n\n画面为单一完整场景，不要宫格和拼贴。使用深靛蓝丝绸作为背景，呈现细腻织物纹理、轻微褶皱与月光般的银蓝反射。\n\n一枚精致的金属针横跨画面中央，针孔被塑造成遥远的拱门。一根朱红与金色交织的丝线穿过针孔，向画面两端延伸；丝线在空中逐渐化为星尘、银河与弧形光轨，连接分处两侧的【两个人物／两件产品】。\n\n两个主体不要直接接触，通过视线、手势、倒影和丝线建立关系。画面中央保留适度距离，让“相隔”成为构图的一部分。\n\n东方深蓝、朱砂红与克制金色配色，超现实微距摄影，高级珠宝广告质感，真实丝线纤维、金属反光与星尘颗粒，安静、浪漫、精致，不要廉价节庆装饰。\n\n顶部预留标题空间，不自动生成文字。\n\n💡 核心逻辑\n\n传统节日设计不是把所有文化符号堆在一起。\n\n这次只提取七夕最核心的动作——穿针引线，再把它转译成“跨越距离、建立连接”的现代视觉隐喻。\n\n针负责制造距离，线负责完成相遇。\n\n🔁 延伸玩法\n\n• 丝线穿过戒指，形成一条微型银河\n• 两瓶香水分处两侧，由气味光轨连接\n• 人物衣服上的刺绣延伸成夜空星座\n• 两座城市的街道灯光在空中织成鹊桥\n• 将静态丝线继续生成流动星河的七夕短片\n\n⚙️ 参数技巧\n\n画面只保留“针、线、两个主体”三个核心元素，不要同时加入满月、喜鹊、灯笼、玫瑰和巨大爱心。\n\n丝线必须连续，从一个主体出发，穿过针孔，再抵达另一个主体。若模型生成多余线头、错误穿插或针孔数量混乱，应局部重绘，不要整张重新生成。\n\n📌 一句话总结\n\n七夕最浪漫的不是把两个人放在一起，而是让观众看见，他们如何跨过距离走向彼此。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQEZhxlbYAAi4Qr.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQEZsAhbMAAAkg3.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQEZsBeagAAN8lT.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQEZsBdbUAAtgDk.jpg"]},{"i":18905,"text":"x VOL.005\n\n两个月前，就做好的一个提示词\n没想到转换成这种上下逻辑\n效果同样很好。\n\n这种类似小时候看的故事绘本风格\nGPT-image2真的好会驾驭哦\n\n爱不释手，停不下来的一组提示词\n\n如下是完整提示词👇：\n\n```\n请将我上传的每一张照片分别制作成一张独立的高级设计海报，不多图拼接，每张照片单独输出。整体采用3:4竖版构图，上下两个区域高度严格1:1，各占画面50%，并确保该表达方式可适配人物、动物、建筑、静物、自然场景等不同主题，而不限于城市题材。\n\n上半部分保留原始照片，保持主体身份、动作、空间关系、真实质感、自然光影和原有色彩氛围，仅进行轻微高级摄影调色，使其具有杂志摄影与艺术出版物的质感。为适配画幅，可自然扩展天空、地面或环境背景，但不得拉伸、扭曲或改变主体。\n\n下半部分提取照片中最具识别性的主体、轮廓、姿态与叙事关系，重构为童话版画式手绘图像。不要机械描摹细节，而是将主体压缩为一两个清楚的大体块，以钝拙剪影、略微夸张的比例和少量关键边缘，保留原始对象的身份、动作、功能与情绪。画面从原图内容中提炼出一个大面积低明度或高反差的结构场，作为包裹主体的容器、路径、框架或密度层；背景像故事发生的外壳一样从原图空间与意义中生长出来，形成遮挡、裁切、吞没与局部露出的结构叙事。整体采用平面叙事透视和绘本页面式层级，可使用俯视压缩、侧向移动、正面框架、路径引导、尺度跳跃或边缘裁切组织阅读。\n\n配色从上方照片提取，并保持明确的三层关系：大面积暗结构色负责重量与边界，适量浅色或留白负责呼吸，小面积高饱和情绪色负责读图路线与故事信号。最重要的信息仅以少量鲜明色块集中在面部、姿态、路径、器物功能点、环境标识或叙事焦点上，并始终被深色结构或浅色负形压住，让画面鲜艳但不平均。色相可随主题情绪调整，但面积比例与明度秩序保持稳定。\n\n线条只在功能、路径、边界、纹理和识别处出现，保持稀疏、手绘、略不准的细线。所有色块保持平面化处理，同时保留干刷、颗粒、飞白、纸纹、喷点和轻微套印错位，呈现丝网印刷与粉蜡笔共同完成的手工质感，避免写实光影、复杂体积、光滑矢量边缘、3D渲染和塑料质感。\n\n整体构图简洁、低细节、高识别，暗场包裹亮色信号，兼具可爱叙事与厚重版画感。若画面包含文字，可将文字处理为小标识、物体面板或边缘注释，数量精简，服从图形结构；字形圆钝，粗细略不均，密度低，带有自然手写感，使其像画面的一部分而不是后期贴上去的说明。整体参考童话绘本、手工版画、编辑插画与艺术出版物气质，呈现统一、鲜明、可迁移的作者化视觉语言。\n\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQEnu2ybAAA2A36.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQEnwFlacAAEEaP.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQEnx3vaIAAmjEr.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQEn2uCbAAEcbI9.jpg"]},{"i":18906,"text":"1:\nA stylized forest scene with tall pine trees rendered in shimmering gold and deep black tones, set against a dark background. The composition features a textured, wavy golden ground and delicate golden outlines of distant mountains and birds in the sky, creating an elegant and luxurious atmosphere with a sense of calm and mystery.\n\nPrompt 2:\nA minimalist and elegant illustration featuring a dark background with a row of stylized pine trees in shimmering gold tones, above undulating golden waves in the foreground; a small flock of golden birds flies above the treetops, creating a serene and luxurious atmosphere with a balanced composition and a modern, sophisticated style.","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQFwLdpXQAAiC8T.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQFwWt8WcAALiqT.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/tweet_video_thumb/HQFwKy6WgAAK504.jpg"]},{"i":18907,"text":"x VOL.010\n\n这是我之前自制的一款很喜欢的提示词\n融合到这个新模式下，别有一番风味\n\n做这种提示词的乐趣\n简单且快乐\n感觉已经进入一种心流状态\n\nprompt by xiaoxiaodong:\n\n```\n请将我上传的每一张照片分别制作成一张独立的高级设计海报，不多图拼接，每张照片单独输出。整体采用3:4竖版构图，上下两个区域高度严格1:1，各占画面50%。\n\n上半部分保留原始照片，保持主体身份、结构、姿态、真实质感、自然光影和原有色彩氛围，仅进行轻微高级摄影调色，使其具有艺术杂志、独立出版物和展览摄影质感。为适配画幅，可自然扩展天空、地面或环境背景，但不得拉伸、扭曲或改变主体。\n\n下半部分提取照片中最具识别性的主体、轮廓、姿态与叙事关系，重构为极简粗黑干媒介剪影插画。不要机械描摹照片细节，而是将主体压缩成圆润、敦厚、略带稚拙感的概括形体，可适度放大头部、主要轮廓或最有记忆点的局部，使其在极少信息下仍能一眼识别原物。若照片包含多个主体，则保留最重要的互动关系，将它们视为一个整体视觉单元，而不是平均分散焦点。\n\n下半部分只使用近乎纯白的纸面底 + 浓黑蜡笔、炭笔或干擦痕迹，不使用彩色，不使用灰阶渐变。黑色形体不是光滑实心矢量块，而是由短促、有力度的蜡笔反复涂抹形成，保留纸张颗粒、断笔、压痕、边缘毛糙、浓淡不均和局部露白。轮廓略微摇晃、不完整、不精确，让画面保持真实手作感。\n\n主体最关键的识别特征可通过“黑色剪影中突然切出的白色特征区”强化，例如脸部、眼睛周围、窗洞、器皿开口、动物面部、物件核心结构或最具有辨识度的局部；再以极少黑点、短线或符号完成表情与细节。不要追求写实五官和精密结构，而是让黑、白之间形成直接、有趣而强烈的辨识关系。\n\n构图保持大面积纯净留白 + 一个主要视觉关系。主体可居中悬浮，也可轻微偏置、局部裁切或靠近画面下方，仅用一条粗糙地面摩擦线、几根短线或极少环境符号提示空间。草叶、雨丝、烟气、桌面、影子、道路、风或其他环境信息都应被压缩成极少的蜡笔记号，让背景保持安静空旷。整体不追求复杂场景，而让一个姿态、动作、距离或关系承担主要叙事。\n\n文字保留少量高级编辑感与童书感并存的小字系统。不要只写地点或物体名称，而从照片中的情绪、动作、关系、时间或微小故事提炼一个简短英文标题，再搭配编号、适配的金句、章节号或一句极短的含蓄小文案。文字可以是克制的印刷小字，也可以加入极少量笨拙手写、蜡笔字或不完全规整的字形，使其像原本就属于这幅插画。\n\n文字需要与图形发生巧妙关系：可以贴着地面线排列、沿主体动作方向延伸、躲在大片留白中、与轮廓产生轻微遮挡、卡在两个主体之间的负形里，或用一条细线把编号与主体连接起来。保持“一个短标题 + 1–2组极小辅助文字”即可，让文字成为构图节奏的一部分，而不是普通海报标题。\n\n整体呈现黑要粗、白要净、形要简、质要糙的视觉特征，在童稚、温软、安静、幽默与孤独之间保持微妙平衡，像一本由高级设计工作室重新编辑的旧黑白童书。避免光滑数字描边、精密线稿、写实光影、厚涂、3D效果、彩色、大面积灰色渲染、卡通贴纸感和模板化商业插画。\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQF3mQeakAASATt.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQF3Hy6bgAAwrRw.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQF3JZ3bgAAnJmG.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQF3MeJaoAACYTA.jpg"]},{"i":18908,"text":"x VOL.012\n\n很久之前做过的一个风格\n这次优化了线条逻辑\n颜色逻辑\n更多元的变化的可能，很有意思的一个提示词\n\n🌷 prompt by xiaoxiaodong: \n\n```\n请将我上传的每一张照片分别制作成一张独立的高级设计海报，不多图拼接，每张照片单独输出。整体采用3:4竖版构图，上下两个区域高度严格1:1，各占画面50%。\n\n上半部分保留原始照片，保持主体结构、真实质感、自然光影和原有色彩氛围，仅进行轻微高级摄影调色，使其具有艺术杂志、独立出版物和展览摄影质感。为适配画幅，可自然扩展天空、地面或环境背景，但不得拉伸、扭曲或改变主体。\n\n下半部分提取照片中最具识别性的**主体、轮廓、姿态与叙事关系**，重构为具有几何秩序的线性实验海报。主体由高密度重复线条、错位描线、短促回环和轻微抖动轨迹聚合显形，保留清晰识别边缘，内部保持不稳定与流动感；外围使用同源但更细、更疏、更轻的线条向外扩散，并以水平、垂直、斜线、圆弧、切线或隐性网格建立理性结构，形成**中心高密度、外围低密度，几何秩序与自由线性并存**的视觉张力。\n\n配色从上方照片中提取**最有生命力、最有辨识度、最能代表主体精气神的颜色**作为主线色，不按面积平均取色，也不刻意做旧降灰；可适度提纯、提亮和校正，使颜色更干净、鲜明、现代。整体采用清洁浅色背景、单一主线色和黑灰微排版，通过线条密度、粗细和叠压形成层次，避免脏色、灰蒙、固定蓝调、多色混杂和数字渐变。\n\n文字作为构图的一部分巧妙介入，从照片的情绪、动作、时间、状态或隐喻中提炼极短英文标题，并搭配少量编号、适配的哲理金句、状态词、标尺或微型注释。文字可沿几何轴线、主体轮廓或线场边界排列，横排、竖排、旋转、穿插或错位，通过极小字号、细字重、宽字距和精确对齐形成高级编辑感，使理性排版压住自由线条的躁动。\n\n整体保持大面积留白、唯一视觉焦点和清晰几何秩序，呈现**干净、克制、锐利、实验、艺术化且富有生命力**的视觉气质。避免随机涂鸦、无方向线团、脏旧复古、赛博科技感、商业宣传感、卡通感和模板感。\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQGJkLQaMAAWS02.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQGKAYGbMAAcQKL.jpg"]},{"i":18909,"text":"x VOL.015\n\n人类对GPT-image2的开发，确实不足0.001%\n\n面对无限可能的AI，我们要有什么心态\n\n我觉得首先就是平和\n平静的学习、平静的多用\n平静的包容它的完美，平静的理解它的进化\n不急不躁\n\n如下是本次风格的提示词：\n\n```\n请将我上传的每一张照片分别制作成一张独立的高级设计海报，不多图拼接，每张照片单独输出。整体采用3:4竖版构图，上下两个区域高度严格1:1，各占画面50%。\n\n上半部分保留原始照片，保持主体结构、空间关系、真实材质、自然光影和原有色彩氛围，仅进行轻微高级摄影调色，使其具有艺术杂志、独立出版物与展览摄影质感。为适配画幅，可自然扩展环境背景，但不得拉伸、扭曲或改变主体。\n\n下半部分以干净象牙色背景，提取照片中最具识别性的主体、轮廓、姿态与叙事关系，按照“解构—筛选—提炼—重构”的逻辑转化为极简抽象视觉。重点保留最独特的体量比例、轴线、曲线、穿插、层叠、遮挡、负空间与非对称关系，用少量几何形体重新组织；不完整复刻细节，但必须一眼感受到与上方原图的对应。构图强调视觉重心、尺度差、主次层级、正负形和留白节奏，避免图标化、平均排列和零碎堆积。\n\n配色全部从上方照片中提取并精简为1个主色、1个深色结构色、1个浅/中性色，最多加入少量关键强调色。优先保留原图中最有辨识度、最有精气神的颜色，通过面积比例、深浅关系和局部对比建立层次，保持干净、克制而有生命力，避免整体灰化与平均用色。\n\n文字建立完整的高级编辑式微排版系统：从照片的光影、空间、动作、材质或情绪中提炼一个2–5词的诗意英文主标题，同时搭配2–4组极小辅助文字，可由短句、状态词、地点或对象信息、编号、章节标记、序列号、尺度式数字、方向词、材质词、档案式标签或微型说明自由组合，不使用年份。主标题负责情绪，小字负责秩序与细节，使文字像艺术书、建筑期刊或展览图录中的编辑注释，而不是普通标题。\n\n文字必须与抽象图形共同构图，可沿几何轴线、边缘、轮廓或负空间排列，也可纵排、旋转、分栏、拉开字距、贴边、压角、跨越色块、嵌入形体之间或与主体形成穿插和对齐；允许一组文字极小、一组稍大，通过字号反差、字距、方向和位置建立阅读路径。整体使用克制的衬线字体与细瘦编辑字体组合，让抽象形体负责视觉记忆，文字负责结构、节奏与高级感。\n\n整体呈现真实摄影 × 抽象记忆 × 编辑排版的视觉气质，现代、安静、克制、精致、艺术化且具有收藏感，避免复杂拼贴、廉价装饰、商业模板感和无意义抽象。\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQGej5TaQAAMDO-.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQGekoCaMAAhjX8.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQGelcbaMAAw0k3.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQGemgnasAAkmlT.jpg"]},{"i":18910,"text":"x VOL.016\n\n图片来自中国国家地理 · 新疆\n\n今年差点去赛里木湖景区当志愿者了\n一想到就还是心驰神往\n\n这组提示词，是我最近24小时，最喜欢的一组\n我感叹：AI就是要这样，成全我手头的图片\n也成全我接下来一整天的好心情\n\n喜欢旅游的朋友， 也可以多用用这组提示词\n超出你想象的惊喜\n甚至废片能变好片\n\n提示词如下 ⤵️\n\n```\n请将我上传的每一张照片分别制作成一张独立的高级设计海报，不多图拼接，每张照片单独输出。整体采用3:4竖版构图，上下两个区域高度严格1:1，各占画面50%。\n\n上半部分保留原始照片，保持主体结构、真实质感、自然光影和原有色彩氛围，仅进行轻微高级摄影调色，使其具有艺术杂志、独立出版物和展览摄影质感。为适配画幅，可自然扩展天空、地面或环境背景，但不得拉伸、扭曲或改变主体。\n\n下半部分提取照片中最具识别性的**主体、轮廓、姿态与叙事关系**，重构为超现实极简版画视觉。将主体压缩成一个清晰而克制的视觉锚点，通常以较小尺度置于大片留白中，仅保留最关键的轮廓与姿态；不要复刻复杂细节，而是让原图中的动作、方向、光影或空间关系转化为围绕主体展开的**动态场域**。\n\n动态场根据主体自身特征自然选择一种主要运动逻辑：可由上而下坠落、沿纵向上升、顺某一方向流动、由核心向外扩散，或形成不规则波纹与回响。使用大量细线、断裂轨迹、粗粝网点和颗粒密度变化表现运动，核心附近更密、更强，向边缘逐渐稀疏、破碎并消失于留白。避免同时堆叠多种特效，让**一个主体、一种运动、一个巨大空间关系**成为画面的核心。\n\n配色从上方照片中提炼**最有辨识度、最有精气神的一个主色**，与暖白、象牙白或自然纸色及少量黑色组成严格的2–3色体系。主色可适度提纯和强化，使其鲜明、有力量但不过度数字化；通过网点密度、油墨叠压与纸面留白形成深浅，而不是普通渐变。保留丝网印刷、Risograph、粗颗粒、纸张纤维、油墨覆盖不均和轻微套印偏差，避免CG、3D、真实光效和光滑数字插画感。\n\n文字建立克制的**实验艺术书微排版系统**。从照片的动作、距离、状态、情绪或隐喻中提炼一个极短英文标题，并搭配2–4组微型文字，可由短句、状态词、地点或对象信息、序列号、坐标式数字、方向词、档案标签或观察注释自由组合。文字可沿地平线、动态轨迹、主体轴线或留白边缘排列，也可纵排、旋转、拉开字距、嵌入颗粒场或被线条轻微穿过，使排版本身参与空间与运动，而不是独立贴在画面上。\n\n整体追求**极小主体、极大留白、强烈尺度反差、单一动态场与粗粝印刷质感**，呈现安静、孤独、神秘、诗意又带有轻微超现实感的实验编辑视觉。无论主体是人物、动物、植物、建筑、器物、交通工具或自然景观，都应保持真实摄影与下方抽象场域之间清晰的身份呼应，避免复杂场景、多重焦点、装饰堆积、普通渐变、商业海报感和模板感。\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQGej5TaQAAMDO-.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQGekoCaMAAhjX8.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQGelcbaMAAw0k3.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQGemgnasAAkmlT.jpg"]},{"i":18911,"text":"x VOL.020\n\n轻松快乐的，弄完了20组提示词\n假装轻松\n哈哈哈\n\n白天要去办理去马来西亚的准备手续...\n\n期待\n\n本组提示词，记得最后补上一行语言偏好自定义 ⤵️\n\n```\n请将我上传的每一张照片分别制作成一张独立的高级设计海报，不多图拼接，每张照片单独输出。整体采用3:4竖版构图，上下两个区域高度严格1:1，各占画面50%。\n\n上半部分保留原始照片，保持主体结构、空间关系、真实材质、自然光影和原有色彩氛围，仅进行轻微高级摄影调色，使其具有艺术杂志、独立出版物与展览摄影质感。为适配画幅，可自然扩展环境背景，但不得拉伸、扭曲或改变主体。\n\n下半部分以干净象牙色背景，提取照片中最具识别性的主体、轮廓、姿态与叙事关系，按照“解构—筛选—提炼—重构”的逻辑转化为极简抽象视觉。重点保留最独特的体量比例、轴线、曲线、穿插、层叠、遮挡、负空间与非对称关系，用少量几何形体重新组织；不完整复刻细节，但必须一眼感受到与上方原图的对应。构图强调视觉重心、尺度差、主次层级、正负形和留白节奏，避免图标化、平均排列和零碎堆积。\n\n配色全部从上方照片中提取并精简为1个主色、1个深色结构色、1个浅/中性色，最多加入少量关键强调色。优先保留原图中最有辨识度、最有精气神的颜色，通过面积比例、深浅关系和局部对比建立层次，保持干净、克制而有生命力，避免整体灰化与平均用色。\n\n文字建立完整的高级编辑式微排版系统：从照片的光影、空间、动作、材质或情绪中提炼一个2–5词的诗意英文主标题，同时搭配2–4组极小辅助文字，可由短句、状态词、地点或对象信息、编号、章节标记、序列号、尺度式数字、方向词、材质词、档案式标签或微型说明自由组合，不使用年份。主标题负责情绪，小字负责秩序与细节，使文字像艺术书、建筑期刊或展览图录中的编辑注释，而不是普通标题。\n\n文字必须与抽象图形共同构图，可沿几何轴线、边缘、轮廓或负空间排列，也可纵排、旋转、分栏、拉开字距、贴边、压角、跨越色块、嵌入形体之间或与主体形成穿插和对齐；允许一组文字极小、一组稍大，通过字号反差、字距、方向和位置建立阅读路径。整体使用克制的衬线字体与细瘦编辑字体组合，让抽象形体负责视觉记忆，文字负责结构、节奏与高级感。\n\n整体呈现真实摄影 × 抽象记忆 × 编辑排版的视觉气质，现代、安静、克制、精致、艺术化且具有收藏感，避免复杂拼贴、廉价装饰、商业模板感和无意义抽象。\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQIbCdrbUAAhneG.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQIbDTZbIAANB9U.jpg"]},{"i":18912,"text":"x VOL.021\n\n从条格漫画逻辑中，吸收的灵感\n花了1个小时，做出了这个提示词\n\n以前好喜欢这个杀手不太冷\n现在重看居然欣赏不了了...奇怪\n\n一个技巧，提示词最后你可以添加一行：\n你的语言偏好，文本就会不是默认的英语\n\n如下是完整提示词，笑纳；\n使用请注明出处，所有我的提示词同理：\n\n```\n请将我上传的每一张照片分别制作成一张独立的高级设计海报，不多图拼接，每张照片单独输出。整体采用3:4竖版构图，上下两个区域高度严格1:1，各占画面50%。\n\n上半部分保留原始照片，保持主体结构、真实质感、自然光影和原有色彩氛围，仅进行轻微高级摄影调色，使其具有艺术杂志、独立出版物与展览摄影质感。为适配画幅，可自然扩展环境背景，但不得拉伸、扭曲或改变主体。\n\n下半部分提取照片中最具识别性的主体、轮廓、姿态与叙事关系，重构为极简黑白手绘编辑插画。以一个横向或纵向的纯黑矩形色域作为主要视觉场，让主体大部分存在于矩形内部，同时选择最具识别度的头部、顶部轮廓、枝叶、屋顶、肢体、器物边缘或其他关键结构自然突破矩形边界，形成明确的“越界”关系。主体不是贴在黑色矩形上，而像从黑色空间中探出、穿过或生长出来，使矩形既是背景，也是构图的一部分。\n\n主体仅保留最必要的外轮廓、姿态和关键结构，以黑色手绘线 + 白色负形 + 少量灰色块面表现。线条像墨笔、针管笔或复印线稿，粗细略有变化，边缘带轻微抖动、断裂、重复描线和手工误差，不追求光滑矢量精度；内部细节极少，只用几笔表情、结构线、折线或局部阴影建立辨识度。无论人物、动物、植物、建筑、器物或风景，都优先找到一个最有性格的局部作为越界焦点。\n\n构图强调黑色矩形的几何秩序与主体自由轮廓之间的冲突。矩形承担稳定、沉重的视觉基座，主体以不对称位置、局部裁切和越界制造活力；大面积白色纸面留白包围黑色区域，使黑、白、灰形成强烈而克制的面积关系。辅助结构可以转化为极少量直线、斜面、平台、边缘或几何切片，但不得形成第二主体。\n\n文字建立轻巧的黑白编辑式微排版系统，从照片的动作、情绪、状态或隐喻中提炼一个简短英文标题，并搭配1–3组极小注释、编号、状态词或短句。文字可贴近黑色矩形边缘、藏在负形中、顺着越界方向排列，或与主体轮廓形成对齐和错位；使用黑色手写字、细瘦无衬线或克制衬线字体，保持小尺度，让文字像插画师留下的签注和编辑标记，而不是商业标题。\n\n整体呈现纯白纸面 × 黑色几何色域 × 稚拙手绘线条 × 主体越界 × 极少灰阶的视觉气质，幽默、克制、聪明、略带古怪和艺术出版感。避免彩色卡通、复杂场景、光滑矢量描边、写实明暗、3D质感、纯黑剪影、规整图标化和模板式居中构图。\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQIbCdrbUAAhneG.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQIbDTZbIAANB9U.jpg"]},{"i":18913,"text":"请基于【主题】自动生成一张“博物馆图录风格的中文拆解信息图”。\n\n整张图要求结合真实主视觉、结构拆解、中文标注、材质说明、纹样含义、色彩含义和核心特征总结。\n\n你需要根据【主题】自动判断最合适的：\n主对象、服饰体系、器物结构、时代风格、关键部件、材料工艺、色彩方案和版面结构，用户不需要再提供其他信息。\n\n整体风格应为：\n国家博物馆展板、历史服饰图录、文化 / 博物馆主题信息图。\n\n背景使用：\n米白、绢白、浅茶色等纸张肌理。\n\n版式固定为：\n顶部主标题 + 副标题 + 简介；\n左侧结构拆解区（中文引线标注关键部件 + 局部细节放大）；\n右上材质 / 工艺 / 纹理区；\n右中纹样 / 色彩 / 含义区；\n底部穿戴顺序 / 构成流程图 + 核心特征总结。\n\n所有文字必须为简体中文，清晰、工整、可读，不得出现乱码、错字、英文或拼音。\n\n这类提示词的核心公式是：\n\n博物馆主视觉 + 结构拆解 + 材质工艺 + 纹样色彩 + 中文标注 + 总结归纳。\n\n💡 核心逻辑\n\n博物馆图录风真正厉害的地方，不是“看起来高级”。\n而是它把 AI 生图从“视觉装饰”，推到了“知识表达”。\n\n一句话理解：\n\n让读者不仅看过，还能带走一个清晰结论。\n📌 一句话总结\n\n博物馆图录风真正厉害的地方，不是把文化内容做得更“好看”，而是把原本分散、抽象、难讲清的知识，整理成一张既能看、又能学、还能收藏的视觉图录。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQKZ1LtacAA-ZkB.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQKZ1LtbIAAxbFF.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQKZ1LubcAAEG4v.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQKZ1LybcAAaWwP.jpg"]},{"i":18914,"text":"Illustration of the Great Wall of China in golden tones winding through emerald green mountains with traditional pagoda watchtowers. Foreground: serene lotus pond with blooming pink lotus flowers and lily pads, large decorative pink and coral flowers. Background: layered misty mountains, large vibrant pink sun in peach-coral gradient sky. Golden ornamental Asian clouds floating. Cherry blossom trees, pine trees throughout landscape. Stylized Asian art aesthetic, flat design with elegant color blocking, decorative illustrative style. Color palette: emerald green, soft pink, coral, gold, peach tones. Ethereal peaceful mood, harmonious composition. Inspired by traditional Chinese landscape painting and modern digital illustration. Vertical composition, highly detailed, 8k quality","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQLjFp_XMAALfiJ.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQLjFqAX0AAk1o2.jpg"]},{"i":18915,"text":"{\n  \"style_name\": \"Fireworks Logo - Close Crop (v2)\",\n  \"description\": \"A photorealistic long-exposure night photograph of a single massive firework burst whose shape and color zones exactly recreate a brand's logo, shot in a tight crop that fills almost the entire frame with the burst itself, with only a thin strip of distant city skyline glimpsed at the very bottom edge — no water or reflection in this crop.\",\n\n  \"user_input\": {\n    \"instructions\": \"The user only needs to provide ONE of the following. Everything else in this template is handled automatically.\",\n    \"option_1\": \"company_name (e.g. 'Google', 'Pepsi', 'McDonald's', 'YouTube')\",\n    \"option_2\": \"uploaded_logo_image\",\n    \"auto_resolution_rules\": [\n      \"If company_name is given, identify the brand's current official logo shape/silhouette and its exact official brand color palette (hex-accurate).\",\n      \"If uploaded_logo_image is given, extract the logo's silhouette and sample its exact colors directly from the file.\",\n      \"Preserve the logo's true proportions and letterform/mark structure — the firework silhouette must be instantly recognizable as that specific logo.\",\n      \"If the logo has multiple distinct color regions (e.g. Google's 'G'), split the firework burst into matching spatial color zones, each occupying the same relative position as in the real logo (e.g. top/left/right/bottom arcs).\"\n    ]\n  },\n\n  \"subject\": {\n    \"primary_element\": \"One large firework explosion whose outer silhouette and internal color zones together trace the brand logo's exact shape\",\n    \"framing\": \"EXTREME CLOSE / DOMINANT — the burst fills approximately 85-90% of the frame height, from near the top edge down to just above the bottom skyline strip; only slim black margins remain at the far left/right corners\",\n    \"scale\": \"Burst spans nearly the full image width edge-to-edge\",\n    \"burst_structure\": [\n      \"Each brand-color region rendered as its own cluster of willow-style light trails — thin, curving, feathery, varying in thickness, fading gradually toward the tips rather than cutting off sharply\",\n      \"3-5 distinct white-hot ignition flares scattered irregularly (not symmetrically) within each color zone, each with a soft glow halo\",\n      \"One color zone (typically whichever forms the densest/blockiest part of the logo, e.g. a crossbar or thick stroke) should be rendered tighter and more chrysanthemum-like — a denser cluster of short bright bursts — to visually contrast with the looser willow trails elsewhere\",\n      \"Adjacent color zones softly bleed/overlap into one another at their shared borders — the separation between logo color regions should NOT look razor-sharp or vector-clean, it should look like real overlapping firework shells\",\n      \"The negative/dark space required by the logo's shape (e.g. the counter of a letter) must be preserved as pure black sky, not filled with sparks\"\n    ]\n  },\n\n  \"logo_color_mapping\": {\n    \"rule\": \"Use the brand's exact official logo colors, spatially arranged to match the real logo's layout.\",\n    \"examples_for_reference_only\": {\n      \"Google\": \"Red (#EA4335) top arc, yellow/gold (#FBBC05) left arc, green (#34A853) bottom arc, blue (#4285F4) right side as a denser blocky cluster forming the G's crossbar, with a dark negative-space gap at the G's opening\",\n      \"Pepsi\": \"Red (#E32934) upper swirl, white (#FFFFFF) diagonal center band, blue (#004B93) lower swirl, matching the Pepsi globe\",\n      \"McDonald's\": \"Solid golden yellow (#FFC72C) twin arches forming the 'M'\",\n      \"YouTube\": \"Red (#FF0000) rounded-rectangle outer burst with a white (#FFFFFF) triangular play-icon burst as the bright core\",\n      \"generic_single_color_logo\": \"Render the entire burst in that one brand color, white-hot at ignition points fading into the saturated brand hue toward the trail tips\"\n    },\n    \"multi_color_logos\": \"Keep each color confined to its correct spatial region of the burst — do not blend colors that aren't adjacent in the real logo\"\n  },\n\n  \"atmosphere_and_secondary_elements\": {\n    \"smoke\": \"Asymmetric gray-white smoke, noticeably concentrated on one side (e.g. lower-left), partially veiling a few trails there; the opposite side/top stays comparatively clear\",\n    \"secondary_fireworks\": \"NONE in this crop — no visible secondary sparkler trails or launch glow; the frame is tight enough that only the main burst is present\",\n    \"embers\": \"A few faint fading spark trails may drift at the lower edge of the burst, mostly absorbed into the smoke\"\n  },\n\n  \"background\": {\n    \"sky\": \"Near-pure black night sky, no stars, no moon, no clouds aside from the firework's own smoke\",\n    \"skyline_strip\": \"A thin, mostly-silhouetted strip of distant low-rise city buildings visible only at the very bottom edge of the frame, occupying no more than the bottom 5-8% of the image height\",\n    \"skyline_lighting\": \"A handful of tiny, sparse warm pinpoint lights (windows/streetlights) within the silhouette — subtle, not a major focal element\",\n    \"water\": \"NOT present in this crop — no water surface, no reflection\"\n  },\n\n  \"photographic_style\": {\n    \"technique\": \"Long-exposure night fireworks photography, DSLR/mirrorless on tripod, telephoto-ish framing tight on the burst\",\n    \"characteristics\": [\n      \"Sharp, crisp light trails consistent with a multi-second exposure\",\n      \"Deep true blacks in the sky with no clipped highlights except at the ignition cores\",\n      \"Natural photographic grain, no digital noise/banding, no illustration or CGI look\",\n      \"Slight soft glow/bloom around the brightest ignition points\",\n      \"Colors read as accurate and true-to-brand, not artificially oversaturated\"\n    ],\n    \"camera_angle\": \"Eye-level, framed tightly enough that the burst occupies nearly the entire vertical frame\",\n    \"aspect_ratio\": \"3:4 portrait\",\n    \"resolution\": \"High resolution, tack-sharp trail detail, professional photography quality\"\n  },\n\n  \"exclusions\": {\n    \"no_ui_overlays\": \"Do NOT include any on-image UI elements — no comparison thumbnail boxes, no 'Logo'/'Style' labels, no before/after chips\",\n    \"no_watermarks\": \"Do NOT include any account handles, watermarks, credits, or captions like 'Swipe for More'\",\n    \"no_flat_logo_overlay\": \"Do NOT paste a flat 2D vector logo anywhere — the logo must exist only as the physical shape of the firework itself\",\n    \"no_water_in_this_variant\": \"Do NOT add a water surface or reflection — this crop is sky/burst + thin skyline strip only\",\n    \"no_extra_text\": \"No text, captions, or subtitles anywhere in the image\"\n  },\n\n  \"negative_prompt\": \"flat vector logo overlay, 2D logo sticker, watermark, username, handle, caption text, UI buttons, comparison thumbnails, before/after boxes, daytime, blue sky, people, crowd, cartoon style, illustration, painting, low resolution, blurry, distorted logo shape, incorrect brand colors, extra unrelated logos, oversaturated flat colors, stars in sky, moon, clipped highlights, overexposed sky, duplicate fireworks, text, subtitles, borders, frame, water, reflection, harbor, ocean, river, large visible skyline, secondary sparkler trails, launch barge glow\"\n}","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSmnvy6boAAfttO.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSmnx-wasAATSlo.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSmnyzbbAAApVso.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSmn12ZboAAkhph.jpg"]},{"i":18916,"text":"东八区的早上了\n再次坚持发送早安提示词\n这次主题：介绍各国早餐\n\n如下是本次完整提示词\n\n```\n围绕任意主题对象呈现轻松的手写观察图谱：大面积洁白纸面作为主要空间，主题内容被拆成若干小块实物状图形、剖面小图、串联小件、短条重复物和局部特写，分散排在纸面中上部与中段，彼此不做严整表格，而是靠近似横向阅读的松散行距、错位留白和手写短语串联，形成像味觉、触感、声音或动作被随手记录下来的亲密节奏。小图形使用主题派生的材料和颜色，保持小尺幅、圆钝外轮廓、轻微透视和手绘上色痕迹，局部保留颗粒、焦边、碎屑、纹理或剖面细节；不要让它们变成统一图标，应像绘本食物插图和手账贴纸之间的实物笔记。文字是画面骨架：使用细黑色手写假名感或童稚手写感线条，字距松、基线轻微跳动，短词围绕图形左右穿插，部分字串贴近图形边缘，部分独立漂浮在空白中，底部可放一行较小署名式说明。色彩由主题自身推导，白纸占最大面积，黑色细字承担信息，主体色保持温暖、清洁、略高明度；少量高饱和暖色或深色只用于图形的焦点、阴影和纹理，点状绿色、褐色或其他主题辅色作为极小面积节奏。整体保持扫描纸张的轻微柔化和自然压缩感，边缘有手绘不齐与颜料吸收，不加厚重阴影、装饰边框或现代排版感；重点是让图形和拟声手写共同制造“边看边读”的清爽童趣信息页。\n\n主题：早安+问候+GOOD MORNING+城市+金句+天气+2026-08-21\n\n一共10个国家经典早餐\n\n10个图片\n\n每个图片都有截然不同的色相逻辑 \n\n每个国家都是对应国家的文字逻辑\n\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQSU96-aoAAex4z.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQSVFBjaUAElLPs.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQSVJsPa4AAlsQ4.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQSVLHrbMAACljs.jpg"]},{"i":18917,"text":"x VOL.031\n\n木刻、断墨、干刷这些质感也不是为了做旧\n而是给几何秩序留一点人的手感\n\n清晨打磨了这套提示词\n会把照片拆成剪影、负形、切面\n\n质感方面：表面挺自由，背地里规矩得很\n\n完整提示词：\n\n```\n请将我上传的每一张照片分别制作成一张独立的高级设计海报，不多图拼接，每张照片单独输出。整体采用3:4竖版构图，上下两个区域高度严格1:1，各占画面50%。\n\n上半部分保留原始照片，保持主体结构、真实质感、自然光影和原有色彩氛围，仅进行轻微高级摄影调色，使其具有艺术出版物与展览摄影质感。为适配画幅，可自然扩展天空、地面或环境背景，但不得拉伸、扭曲或改变主体。\n\n下半部分提取照片中最具识别性的**主体、轮廓、姿态与叙事关系**，先理解其核心寓意、文化属性或情绪关系，再重构为具有民俗图录、古物拓片与现代平面设计气质的图形画面。不要把照片中的元素逐一翻译，也不要添加泛泛的传统纹样；只保留**一个核心视觉母题与极少量真正有叙事意义的辅助形态**，通过剪影、负形、局部放大、形态合并与符号化转译，使图形既能对应原物，又能表达其背后的意义。\n\n构图建立在严谨的**几何骨架与比例系统**之上，根据主体自身的结构提炼圆、方、三角、弧线、轴线或重复比例作为“几何母体”，再让所有主体、辅助图形、文字和留白与其发生对齐、切线、共轴、嵌套、镜像、比例递进或边界裁切关系。版面可以自由分布、偏心、越界或不对称，但必须共享同一套结构逻辑，形成清晰的视觉重心、层级、节奏与负空间；远看秩序明确，近看才发现传统印痕与细节变化，避免随机散点和装饰性堆砌。\n\n配色从上方照片中提取最具辨识度、生命力与精神气质的颜色，重新归纳为清爽克制的纸面印刷色组。以明亮浅色纸底形成呼吸感，用一个深色建立视觉骨架，再以1–2个源自原图的主题色组织主体和少量强调，通过面积比例、叠印与明度关系建立层次，颜色应干净、有精神，避免灰脏做旧、固定民俗配色和杂乱多色。\n\n材质采用**木刻拓印、干刷丝网印与旧式图录印刷**的混合质感，断墨、擦痕、露底和不均匀墨量主要存在于图形内部，几何边界、重要轮廓和整体版式仍保持清晰准确，形成“粗粝物质感 × 严谨几何秩序”的对比。\n\n文字仅作为构图中的辅助信息，从照片的主题、寓意或文化属性中提炼少量标题与微型注释，可顺应几何轴线、负形或图形边界自由排布，与主体形成对齐、嵌套或穿插关系，但不抢夺视觉中心。\n\n整体呈现**寓意先行、图形克制、几何严谨、拓印粗粝、留白清晰、传统文化感与现代设计秩序并存**的视觉气质。每一个出现的图形都必须有来源、有寓意、有结构作用；删除不能增强主题理解的装饰元素，避免素材拼贴、传统符号乱入、平均排版、写实插画和模板感\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQNbqD4bcAAigI-.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQNbsxLbsAAWSMe.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQNcBTHasAAoH2E.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQNcWGjbcAAItHS.jpg"]},{"i":18918,"text":"可以直接这样写：\n\n请基于上传的人像照片，生成一张“真人走进方块像素世界”的创意图像。\n\n要求人物主体保持100%真实，不要卡通化，不要像素化，不要改变人物身份特征。\n\n必须完整保留：\n人物的面部结构、肤色质感、发型、服装、表情、姿势、身体比例与真实摄影质感。\n\n只重建环境部分，将背景转换为高完成度的方块体素世界。\n把树木、草地、道路、建筑、岩石、天空与地形全部改造成清晰的立方体结构，并带有像素贴图质感。\n\n画面要形成明确反差：\n人物是真实摄影质感，\n环境是方块像素世界质感。\n\n同时保证二者自然融合：\n人物继续保持真实光照，\n环境具有方块阴影、像素化结构、轻微空气透视与游戏氛围雾感，\n让真实人物像真正站在像素世界里。\n\n整体效果要像：\n真实人物误入游戏宇宙，\n而不是普通滤镜，\n也不是整张图一起像素化。\n\n适合社交媒体传播，视觉反差强，第一眼有冲击力。\n\n这类提示词的核心公式是：\n\n锁定真人主体 + 只改环境 + 强化方块结构 + 保持光影融合 + 制造真实与像素的反差。\n\n📌 一句话总结\n\n真人走进方块世界这个玩法最厉害的地方，不是把图片做得更“像游戏”，而是让 AI 在一张图里同时讲清楚两种视觉规则：人物属于现实，环境属于像素宇宙。","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQNrsG5agAAakMe.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQNrsG6a0AAM53m.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQNrsG6bYAIQloy.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQNrsG6aMAAmjfV.jpg"]},{"i":18919,"text":"x 补充\n\n这是我今天最喜欢的这套提示词\n\n忍不住多做了几个样张\n\n其实，不要上半部分，要求只输出下半部分的画面\n\n比如用作1:2的壁纸\n也会有惊喜的结果\n\n补充这组提示词的英文版吧：\n\n```\nPlease turn each photo I upload into a separate premium-designed poster, with no multi-image collage; output each photo as an independent poster. Use an overall 3:4 vertical composition, strictly divided into two equal-height sections, with the upper and lower halves each occupying exactly 50% of the canvas. The upper half should preserve the original photograph, maintaining the subject’s structure, realistic texture, natural lighting and shadows, and original color atmosphere, with only subtle high-end photographic color grading to give it the quality of an art publication or exhibition photograph. To adapt the image to the required aspect ratio, you may naturally extend the sky, ground, or environmental background, but you must not stretch, distort, or alter the main subject. The lower half should extract the most recognizable subject, silhouette, posture, and narrative relationship from the photograph; first understand its core meaning, cultural attributes, or emotional relationship, then reconstruct it into a graphic composition combining the character of a folk-culture catalog, antique rubbing prints, and modern graphic design. Do not translate every element in the photograph one by one, and do not add generic traditional patterns; retain only one core visual motif and a very small number of auxiliary forms that truly carry narrative significance. Use silhouette, negative space, partial enlargement, shape merging, and symbolic transformation so that the graphic not only corresponds to the original object but also expresses the meaning behind it. Build the composition on a rigorous geometric framework and proportional system: derive circles, squares, triangles, arcs, axes, or repeated proportions from the structure of the subject itself as the “geometric matrix,” then align all main forms, secondary graphics, typography, and negative space through shared tangencies, common axes, nesting, mirroring, proportional progression, or edge cropping relationships. The layout may be freely distributed, off-center, extend beyond boundaries, or be asymmetrical, but every element must obey the same structural logic, creating a clear visual center of gravity, hierarchy, rhythm, and negative space; from a distance the order should be immediately legible, while closer viewing should reveal traditional print traces and subtle details. Avoid random scattered elements and decorative accumulation. Extract the most distinctive, lively, and spiritually expressive colors from the upper photograph and reorganize them into a clean, restrained paper-printing palette. Use a bright, light paper-colored background to create breathing room, one dark color to establish the visual skeleton, and one or two theme colors derived from the original photograph to organize the main subject and limited accents. Build depth through area ratios, overprinting, and tonal contrast. Colors should feel clean, vivid, and spirited; avoid muddy artificial aging, fixed stereotypical folk palettes, or chaotic multicolor combinations. Use a hybrid material texture combining woodblock rubbing, dry-brush screen printing, and vintage catalog printing. Broken ink, abrasion marks, exposed paper, and uneven ink density should mainly appear inside the graphic forms, while geometric boundaries, important contours, and the overall layout should remain crisp and precise, creating a contrast between “rough material texture × rigorous geometric order.” Typography should function only as supporting compositional information. Extract a small amount of title text and micro-annotations from the photograph’s theme, meaning, or cultural attributes, and allow them to follow geometric axes, negative space, or graphic boundaries in flexible arrangements, aligning, nesting, or interweaving with the main forms without competing for the visual center. The overall visual character should prioritize meaning, restrained graphics, rigorous geometry, rough rubbing textures, clear negative space, and the coexistence of traditional cultural sensibility with modern design order. Every graphic element that appears must have a source, a meaning, and a structural function; remove anything that does not strengthen understanding of the theme, and avoid collage-like material assembly, arbitrary insertion of traditional symbols, evenly distributed layouts, realistic illustration, and template-like design. \n\n💣Text preference: Japanese.\n```","imgs":["https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQPYJOGaIAAsdZ9.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQPYOqXaIAA7C8b.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQPYP2lbEAEW6Y4.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQPYW2uaAAAi-zu.jpg"]}];